{:edb/db-before-t 1586 :edb/db-after-t 1587 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534899 50 #inst "2026-10-12T22:36:16.385Z" 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186119653 1071 "Find the shortest distance between the point $P(5,2,-2)$ and the plane $\\Pi$ with equation ![](images/40/40ec5f2b2615eedf6b16420a2089b7c377141db46237de35218c5e685b629918.png)" 13194139534899 17592186045417 false] [17592186119653 1071 "Find the shortest distance between the point $P(5,2,-2)$ and the plane $\\Pi$ with equation ![](images/f9/f9fe9fa5e18e286ac7e026df2667c7a8ce259cd2c0416efe85d66d2546358dfd.svg)" 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186119653 1074 "Let's pick a point on the plane, for instance, $Q(4,8,2).$ Then \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAlso, from the equation of the plane, we get a normal vector ![](images/05/0589ebbdb2c14b93e1296b9e1f8b0caa0c3df49bff4c9fbb97e4c18102844ec1.png)\n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $\\Pi$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overrightarrow{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|(-1)\\cdot 2+6\\cdot 4+4\\cdot (-4)|}{\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+{4}^{2}+(-4)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|-2+24-16|}{\\sqrt{4+16+16}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\,6\\,|}{\\sqrt{36}} \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534899 17592186045417 false] [17592186119653 1074 "Let's pick a point on the plane, for instance, $Q(4,8,2).$ Then \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAlso, from the equation of the plane, we get a normal vector ![](images/9e/9e7b8bc888dbf7a764c0d5b9533758277b59e78d476a3cfe7bbfb2fcac7e7363.svg)\n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $\\Pi$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overrightarrow{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|(-1)\\cdot 2+6\\cdot 4+4\\cdot (-4)|}{\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+{4}^{2}+(-4)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|-2+24-16|}{\\sqrt{4+16+16}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\,6\\,|}{\\sqrt{36}} \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186119839 1038 #edb/ref 17592186443267 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186119840 1038 #edb/ref 17592186443265 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186119840 1038 #edb/ref 17592186443268 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186119841 1038 #edb/ref 17592186443266 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186120020 1050 960.0 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186443241 1080 "\\sqrt{11}" 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186443241 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186443241 1083 #uuid "088db5f4-36d3-5c78-98a0-f200bd4afcc7" 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186443242 1080 "\\sqrt{13}" 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186443242 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186443242 1083 #uuid "168db077-1d3d-5cb0-b6aa-9a45c778361c" 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186443243 1080 "2\\sqrt{6}" 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186443243 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186443243 1083 #uuid "1d85d58b-d2c6-50e6-b647-b9ac50af4bb1" 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186443244 1080 "3" 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186443244 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [17592186443244 1083 #uuid "31b8c44f-f4d9-57d8-90d2-99d7decf9188" 13194139534899 17592186045417 true] [175